{"html": "\n<h2 data-end=\"303\" data-section-id=\"4t5o08\" data-start=\"265\">🧬 What Are Peptides? (Simple Guide)</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://www2.chemistry.msu.edu/faculty/reusch/virttxtjml/Images3/peptide7.gif\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://www2.chemistry.msu.edu/faculty/reusch/virttxtjml/Images3/peptide7.gif\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://www2.chemistry.msu.edu/faculty/reusch/virttxtjml/Images3/peptide7.gif\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www2.chemistry.msu.edu/faculty/reusch/virttxtjml/Images3/peptide7.gif\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://assets.technologynetworks.com/production/dynamic/images/content/324357/essential-amino-acids-chart-abbreviations-and-structure-324357-960x540.jpg?cb=13350770\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://assets.technologynetworks.com/production/dynamic/images/content/324357/essential-amino-acids-chart-abbreviations-and-structure-324357-960x540.jpg?cb=13350770\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://assets.technologynetworks.com/production/dynamic/images/content/324357/essential-amino-acids-chart-abbreviations-and-structure-324357-960x540.jpg?cb=13350770\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.technologynetworks.com/production/dynamic/images/content/324357/essential-amino-acids-chart-abbreviations-and-structure-324357-960x540.jpg?cb=13350770\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://cellgs.e2ecdn.co.uk/Pages/amino-acid-peptide-and-protein.jpg\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://cellgs.e2ecdn.co.uk/Pages/amino-acid-peptide-and-protein.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://cellgs.e2ecdn.co.uk/Pages/amino-acid-peptide-and-protein.jpg\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cellgs.e2ecdn.co.uk/Pages/amino-acid-peptide-and-protein.jpg\"/></noscript></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">4</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-end=\"445\" data-start=\"347\">Peptides are one of the fastest-growing categories in health, fitness, and medical research today.</p>\n<p data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"447\">From <strong data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"452\">weight loss breakthroughs like GLP-1 SMA</strong> to healing compounds like <strong data-end=\"536\" data-start=\"525\">BPC-157</strong>, peptides are everywhere — in clinical research, biohacking communities, and mainstream medicine.</p>\n<p data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"636\">But what exactly are peptides — and why do they matter?</p>\n<p data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"693\">This guide breaks everything down in <strong data-end=\"760\" data-start=\"730\">simple, no-jargon language</strong>.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"766\" data-start=\"763\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"786\" data-section-id=\"9psmwd\" data-start=\"768\">⚡ Quick Summary</h2>\n<ul data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"788\">\n<li data-end=\"835\" data-section-id=\"1f4g18n\" data-start=\"788\">Peptides = short chains of amino acids (2–50)</li>\n<li data-end=\"888\" data-section-id=\"em7z4a\" data-start=\"836\">Your body naturally produces thousands of peptides</li>\n<li data-end=\"926\" data-section-id=\"4ybmtk\" data-start=\"889\">They act as <strong data-end=\"926\" data-start=\"903\">chemical messengers</strong></li>\n<li data-end=\"972\" data-section-id=\"10o8rxm\" data-start=\"927\">Over <strong data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"934\">100 peptide drugs are FDA-approved</strong></li>\n<li data-end=\"1011\" data-section-id=\"149r6os\" data-start=\"973\">Market size: <strong data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"988\">$52+ billion (2025)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"1013\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"1042\" data-section-id=\"jpxyky\" data-start=\"1018\">🧠 What Are Peptides?</h2>\n<p data-end=\"1131\" data-start=\"1044\">Peptides are short chains of amino acids — the same building blocks that make proteins.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1133\">👉 Think of it like this:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1161\">\n<li data-end=\"1186\" data-section-id=\"1bkbvgg\" data-start=\"1161\">Amino acids = letters</li>\n<li data-end=\"1213\" data-section-id=\"d4lypc\" data-start=\"1187\">Peptides = short words</li>\n<li data-end=\"1243\" data-section-id=\"5mstzw\" data-start=\"1214\">Proteins = full sentences</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1245\">Your body uses peptides to <strong data-end=\"1302\" data-start=\"1272\">send signals between cells</strong>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1305\">They control things like:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"1407\" data-start=\"1331\">\n<li data-end=\"1343\" data-section-id=\"sp2yo7\" data-start=\"1331\">Hormones</li>\n<li data-end=\"1367\" data-section-id=\"45qvza\" data-start=\"1344\">Hunger &amp; metabolism</li>\n<li data-end=\"1390\" data-section-id=\"19pfr0t\" data-start=\"1368\">Healing &amp; recovery</li>\n<li data-end=\"1407\" data-section-id=\"1gpcrew\" data-start=\"1391\">Sleep &amp; mood</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\">👉 In simple terms:<br data-end=\"1431\" data-start=\"1428\"/><strong data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1431\">Peptides = your body’s communication system</strong></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"1511\" data-section-id=\"htviqb\" data-start=\"1485\">🔬 Peptides vs Proteins</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/3-s2.0-B9780128179093000169-f16-03-9780128179093.jpg\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/3-s2.0-B9780128179093000169-f16-03-9780128179093.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/3-s2.0-B9780128179093000169-f16-03-9780128179093.jpg\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/3-s2.0-B9780128179093000169-f16-03-9780128179093.jpg\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://fiveable.me/_next/image?q=75&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fstatic.prod.fiveable.me%2Fsearch-images%252F%2522Four_levels_of_protein_structure%253A_primary%252C_secondary%252C_tertiary%252C_quaternary_with_diagrams_and_examples.%2522-OSC_Microbio_07_04_proteinstr.jpg&amp;w=3840\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://fiveable.me/_next/image?q=75&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fstatic.prod.fiveable.me%2Fsearch-images%252F%2522Four_levels_of_protein_structure%253A_primary%252C_secondary%252C_tertiary%252C_quaternary_with_diagrams_and_examples.%2522-OSC_Microbio_07_04_proteinstr.jpg&amp;w=3840\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://fiveable.me/_next/image?q=75&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fstatic.prod.fiveable.me%2Fsearch-images%252F%2522Four_levels_of_protein_structure%253A_primary%252C_secondary%252C_tertiary%252C_quaternary_with_diagrams_and_examples.%2522-OSC_Microbio_07_04_proteinstr.jpg&amp;w=3840\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fiveable.me/_next/image?q=75&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fstatic.prod.fiveable.me%2Fsearch-images%252F%2522Four_levels_of_protein_structure%253A_primary%252C_secondary%252C_tertiary%252C_quaternary_with_diagrams_and_examples.%2522-OSC_Microbio_07_04_proteinstr.jpg&amp;w=3840\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://figures.semanticscholar.org/7639644cc4ffc23a2d717df37208b61fda229111/7-Table4-1.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://figures.semanticscholar.org/7639644cc4ffc23a2d717df37208b61fda229111/7-Table4-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://figures.semanticscholar.org/7639644cc4ffc23a2d717df37208b61fda229111/7-Table4-1.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://figures.semanticscholar.org/7639644cc4ffc23a2d717df37208b61fda229111/7-Table4-1.png\"/></noscript></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">4</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-end=\"1761\" data-start=\"1555\">\n<thead data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1555\">\n<tr data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1555\">\n<th class=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1565\" data-start=\"1555\">Feature</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1576\" data-start=\"1565\">Peptides</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1576\">Proteins</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-end=\"1761\" data-start=\"1619\">\n<tr data-end=\"1664\" data-start=\"1619\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1626\" data-start=\"1619\">Size</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1645\" data-start=\"1626\">2–50 amino acids</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1664\" data-start=\"1645\">50+ amino acids</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end=\"1711\" data-start=\"1665\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1677\" data-start=\"1665\">Structure</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1693\" data-start=\"1677\">Simple chains</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1711\" data-start=\"1693\">Complex folded</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end=\"1761\" data-start=\"1712\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1723\" data-start=\"1712\">Function</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1723\">Signaling</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"1761\" data-start=\"1735\">Structural &amp; enzymatic</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1763\">👉 Simple takeaway:<br data-end=\"1785\" data-start=\"1782\"/><strong data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1785\">Peptides = signals</strong><br data-end=\"1810\" data-start=\"1807\"/><strong data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1810\">Proteins = builders</strong></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1838\" data-start=\"1835\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"1863\" data-section-id=\"yveyaw\" data-start=\"1840\">⚙️ How Peptides Work</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://www.rxteach.com/content/images/2025/01/keylockex.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://www.rxteach.com/content/images/2025/01/keylockex.png\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://www.rxteach.com/content/images/2025/01/keylockex.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.rxteach.com/content/images/2025/01/keylockex.png\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)]\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/374151604/figure/fig1/AS%3A11431281245626237%401716196402678/Schematic-illustration-of-the-mechanism-of-action-of-protein-or-peptide-decoys-Decoy.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/374151604/figure/fig1/AS%3A11431281245626237%401716196402678/Schematic-illustration-of-the-mechanism-of-action-of-protein-or-peptide-decoys-Decoy.png\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/374151604/figure/fig1/AS%3A11431281245626237%401716196402678/Schematic-illustration-of-the-mechanism-of-action-of-protein-or-peptide-decoys-Decoy.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/374151604/figure/fig1/AS%3A11431281245626237%401716196402678/Schematic-illustration-of-the-mechanism-of-action-of-protein-or-peptide-decoys-Decoy.png\"/></noscript></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-perseus-images/6e93dcc90ee1eca0ce073e3856155110089d1f38.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-perseus-images/6e93dcc90ee1eca0ce073e3856155110089d1f38.png\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=\"/><noscript><img alt=\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-perseus-images/6e93dcc90ee1eca0ce073e3856155110089d1f38.png\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/ka-perseus-images/6e93dcc90ee1eca0ce073e3856155110089d1f38.png\"/></noscript></div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-0 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5\">\n<div class=\"shrink-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">4</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p data-end=\"1952\" data-start=\"1907\">Peptides work like a <strong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1928\">key entering a lock</strong>.</p>\n<ol data-end=\"2056\" data-start=\"1954\">\n<li data-end=\"1985\" data-section-id=\"1hj14vi\" data-start=\"1954\">Peptide enters bloodstream</li>\n<li data-end=\"2008\" data-section-id=\"94rqrc\" data-start=\"1986\">Finds target cell</li>\n<li data-end=\"2031\" data-section-id=\"yovjmh\" data-start=\"2009\">Binds to receptor</li>\n<li data-end=\"2056\" data-section-id=\"1lujdjq\" data-start=\"2032\">Triggers a response</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-end=\"2081\" data-start=\"2058\">That response could be:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"2144\" data-start=\"2082\">\n<li data-end=\"2094\" data-section-id=\"19gbtq0\" data-start=\"2082\">Fat loss</li>\n<li data-end=\"2112\" data-section-id=\"1c4fb4o\" data-start=\"2095\">Muscle growth</li>\n<li data-end=\"2124\" data-section-id=\"1r5oow8\" data-start=\"2113\">Healing</li>\n<li data-end=\"2144\" data-section-id=\"jzb0yl\" data-start=\"2125\">Hormone release</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"2149\" data-start=\"2146\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"2194\" data-section-id=\"1nxhiks\" data-start=\"2151\">💉 Example: GLP-1 (Weight Loss Peptides)</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2269\" data-start=\"2196\">GLP-1 peptides (like GLP-1 SMA) are the biggest breakthrough right now.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2276\" data-start=\"2271\">They:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"2344\" data-start=\"2277\">\n<li data-end=\"2296\" data-section-id=\"1iwgzog\" data-start=\"2277\">Reduce appetite</li>\n<li data-end=\"2325\" data-section-id=\"v73pzv\" data-start=\"2297\">Improve insulin response</li>\n<li data-end=\"2344\" data-section-id=\"okcy3z\" data-start=\"2326\">Slow digestion</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"2382\" data-start=\"2346\">👉 Result: <strong data-end=\"2382\" data-start=\"2357\">sustained weight loss</strong></p>\n<hr data-end=\"2387\" data-start=\"2384\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"2412\" data-section-id=\"ky99kq\" data-start=\"2389\">🧩 Types of Peptides</h2>\n<h3 data-end=\"2437\" data-section-id=\"c3lygf\" data-start=\"2414\">1. Hormone Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2462\" data-start=\"2438\">\n<li data-end=\"2449\" data-section-id=\"ajhb1e\" data-start=\"2438\">Insulin</li>\n<li data-end=\"2462\" data-section-id=\"15dq4bd\" data-start=\"2450\">Oxytocin</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2487\" data-section-id=\"1cxo574\" data-start=\"2464\">2. Healing Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2510\" data-start=\"2488\">\n<li data-end=\"2499\" data-section-id=\"p9thk7\" data-start=\"2488\">BPC-157</li>\n<li data-end=\"2510\" data-section-id=\"1jy7pc6\" data-start=\"2500\">TB-500</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2534\" data-section-id=\"1ue37k\" data-start=\"2512\">3. Growth Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2562\" data-start=\"2535\">\n<li data-end=\"2547\" data-section-id=\"1xlwydc\" data-start=\"2535\">CJC-1295</li>\n<li data-end=\"2562\" data-section-id=\"hrinse\" data-start=\"2548\">Ipamorelin</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2588\" data-section-id=\"19hv4na\" data-start=\"2564\">4. Fat Loss Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2620\" data-start=\"2589\">\n<li data-end=\"2604\" data-section-id=\"hicnqo\" data-start=\"2589\">GLP-1 SMA</li>\n<li data-end=\"2620\" data-section-id=\"1nld6ol\" data-start=\"2605\">GLP-2 TRZ</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2646\" data-section-id=\"rpqc65\" data-start=\"2622\">5. Skin &amp; Anti-Aging</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2679\" data-start=\"2647\">\n<li data-end=\"2657\" data-section-id=\"19c31ef\" data-start=\"2647\">GHK-Cu</li>\n<li data-end=\"2679\" data-section-id=\"o1fulf\" data-start=\"2658\">Collagen peptides</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"2684\" data-start=\"2681\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"2719\" data-section-id=\"1nj76eh\" data-start=\"2686\">🏥 What Are Peptides Used For?</h2>\n<div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\">\n<div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl\">\n<div class=\"group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full\">\n<div><img alt=\"https://www.cellular-cosmetics.com/cdn/shop/products/CellularCosmeticsPrivateLabelSkinCareAustralianCosmeticManufacture_0ca03d29-e2dc-43c4-89d6-0c4db42d73b2.jpg?v=1744099728\" class=\"bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://www.cellular-cosmetics.com/cdn/shop/products/CellularCosmeticsPrivateLabelSkinCareAustralianCosmeticManufacture_0