\" data-start=\"2776\">\n<li data-end=\"2796\" data-section-id=\"12nt6ui\" data-start=\"2776\">Diabetes (insulin)</li>\n<li data-end=\"2820\" data-section-id=\"kwqiw6\" data-start=\"2797\">Obesity (GLP-1 drugs)</li>\n<li data-end=\"2842\" data-section-id=\"l9fnsb\" data-start=\"2821\">Hormonal treatments</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2856\" data-section-id=\"1vbmnt8\" data-start=\"2844\">Skincare</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2906\" data-start=\"2857\">\n<li data-end=\"2871\" data-section-id=\"s3f5rl\" data-start=\"2857\">Anti-aging</li>\n<li data-end=\"2890\" data-section-id=\"vodgfg\" data-start=\"2872\">Collagen boost</li>\n<li data-end=\"2906\" data-section-id=\"1lx8zoq\" data-start=\"2891\">Skin repair</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2919\" data-section-id=\"1wx3p5i\" data-start=\"2908\">Fitness</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"2961\" data-start=\"2920\">\n<li data-end=\"2932\" data-section-id=\"1lf4t2j\" data-start=\"2920\">Recovery</li>\n<li data-end=\"2945\" data-section-id=\"19gbtq0\" data-start=\"2933\">Fat loss</li>\n<li data-end=\"2961\" data-section-id=\"lu9rww\" data-start=\"2946\">Performance</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"2975\" data-section-id=\"11y5d5r\" data-start=\"2963\">Research</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"3018\" data-start=\"2976\">\n<li data-end=\"2996\" data-section-id=\"ioyke7\" data-start=\"2976\">Drug development</li>\n<li data-end=\"3018\" data-section-id=\"1i2dgzl\" data-start=\"2997\">Longevity science</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"3023\" data-start=\"3020\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"3049\" data-section-id=\"1xhz9xf\" data-start=\"3025\">🧪 Are Peptides Safe?</h2>\n<p data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"3051\">👉 Depends on the type:</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"3103\" data-section-id=\"tg3wcs\" data-start=\"3076\">✅ FDA-Approved Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"3170\" data-start=\"3104\">\n<li data-end=\"3125\" data-section-id=\"1115k85\" data-start=\"3104\">Clinically tested</li>\n<li data-end=\"3170\" data-section-id=\"p85drw\" data-start=\"3126\">Generally safe under medical supervision</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-end=\"3196\" data-section-id=\"nq70fu\" data-start=\"3172\">⚠️ Research Peptides</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"3259\" data-start=\"3197\">\n<li data-end=\"3219\" data-section-id=\"ifhedv\" data-start=\"3197\">Limited human data</li>\n<li data-end=\"3238\" data-section-id=\"ee99of\" data-start=\"3220\">Quality varies</li>\n<li data-end=\"3259\" data-section-id=\"9dvsxk\" data-start=\"3239\">Not FDA-approved</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"3318\" data-start=\"3261\">👉 Important:<br data-end=\"3277\" data-start=\"3274\"/>Always consult a professional before use.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"3323\" data-start=\"3320\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"3353\" data-section-id=\"iojugb\" data-start=\"3325\">💊 How Peptides Are Taken</h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-end=\"3495\" data-start=\"3355\">\n<thead data-end=\"3371\" data-start=\"3355\">\n<tr data-end=\"3371\" data-start=\"3355\">\n<th class=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3364\" data-start=\"3355\">Method</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3371\" data-start=\"3364\">Use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-end=\"3495\" data-start=\"3386\">\n<tr data-end=\"3416\" data-start=\"3386\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3398\" data-start=\"3386\">Injection</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3416\" data-start=\"3398\">Most effective</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end=\"3435\" data-start=\"3417\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3424\" data-start=\"3417\">Oral</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3435\" data-start=\"3424\">Limited</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end=\"3472\" data-start=\"3436\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3444\" data-start=\"3436\">Nasal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3472\" data-start=\"3444\">Brain-targeting peptides</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-end=\"3495\" data-start=\"3473\">\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3483\" data-start=\"3473\">Topical</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"3495\" data-start=\"3483\">Skincare</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr data-end=\"3500\" data-start=\"3497\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"3519\" data-section-id=\"1cgkwnz\" data-start=\"3502\">❌ Common Myths</h2>\n<ul data-end=\"3634\" data-start=\"3521\">\n<li data-end=\"3558\" data-section-id=\"1b1s6af\" data-start=\"3521\">“Peptides are steroids” → ❌ False</li>\n<li data-end=\"3599\" data-section-id=\"1fy2ui9\" data-start=\"3559\">“All peptides are illegal” → ❌ False</li>\n<li data-end=\"3634\" data-section-id=\"qi0u6y\" data-start=\"3600\">“More is better” → ❌ Dangerous</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"3639\" data-start=\"3636\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"3650\" data-section-id=\"1wtahyr\" data-start=\"3641\">❓ FAQs</h2>\n<p data-end=\"3707\" data-start=\"3652\"><strong data-end=\"3677\" data-start=\"3652\">Are peptides natural?</strong><br data-end=\"3680\" data-start=\"3677\"/>Yes — your body makes them.</p>\n<p data-end=\"3777\" data-start=\"3709\"><strong data-end=\"3727\" data-start=\"3709\">Are they safe?</strong><br data-end=\"3730\" data-start=\"3727\"/>Approved ones → yes<br data-end=\"3752\" data-start=\"3749\"/>Research ones → depends</p>\n<p data-end=\"3846\" data-start=\"3779\"><strong data-end=\"3796\" data-start=\"3779\">Do they work?</strong><br data-end=\"3799\" data-start=\"3796\"/>Some have strong clinical evidence (like GLP-1)</p>\n"}